Z||000008||Monkeyman||06-23-2000||05:01 PM||||Airborne Ranger.  Brings back memories.  I made it through Hell Week and decided that I just wasn't that tough! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  I probably could have made it but who knows.  Only about 18% of those that start Ranger school (after Hell Week) ever graduate.  If I'd gone Ranger, I'd still probably be in the Army.  I'd have gotten laser surgery to correct my vision and gone to chopper school.  Then everyone could call me Mr.  Got a buddy of mine who did just that.  W3 now flying Apaches.  I could have been him. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif">||||reg||1
